  "id": "Compound::DB01078 - Gene::481",
  "verbalization": "Deslanoside appears to interact with Atp1b1 through a shared pathway involving the Fxyd2 protein. The evidence suggests that Deslanoside binds to Fxyd2, which then participates in potassium-transporting or sodium-potassium-exchanging Atpase activities. These activities are ultimately participated by Atp1b1, indicating a potential functional link between Deslanoside and Atp1b1. The integration of these pathways highlights a possible mechanism by which Deslanoside influences Atp1b1's function, possibly through modulation of ion transport processes. The consistent binding of Deslanoside to Fxyd2 and its involvement in Atpase activities provide a robust foundation for this relationship, though the exact mechanism of interaction remains to be fully elucidated.",
